{"id":"wb-7-975","name":"先蚕祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"先蚕祠","text":"先蚕祠俗称“蚕花殿”，位于江苏省苏州市吴江区盛泽镇蚕花路。\n\n祭祀丝业祖师轩辕、神农和嫘祖的公祠，1840年由盛泽丝业商人公建，有正殿、戏楼、议事厅等，丝业公所曾设此。\n\n2013年列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%88%E8%9A%95%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":91798016,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91798016","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c424d237bb54daf750bdf00d.jpg","title":"盛泽先蚕祠,_2026-03-07_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9B%9B%E6%B3%BD%E5%85%88%E8%9A%95%E7%A5%A0,_2026-03-07_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/%E7%9B%9B%E6%B3%BD%E5%85%88%E8%9A%95%E7%A5%A0%2C_2026-03-07_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​盛泽先蚕祠","width":320,"height":214},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}